{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And blasted (שדופות) eastward.</b> An easterly wind is called קדים because the sun is first (קודם) to shine in it in the morning, and likewise קדמה — eastward. And מערב (west) because the sun sets in it in the evening (ערב)."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:10.436788809Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}